                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 11.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McWade to Mr. Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Canton</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-03-18"><hi rendition="#italic">March 18,
                        1902</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Viceroy reports rebellion Kuangsi almost crushed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McWade</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
